1
00:00:21,967 --> 00:00:25,141
Thanks… for taking me to the doctor.
And for dropping me off.

2
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:29,311
No problem. If you really wanna thank me,
just buy me a drink sometime.

3
00:00:30,255 --> 00:00:34,318
No way. You're rich enough. Get your own.

4
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,393
Heartless, dude.

5
00:00:40,208 --> 00:00:43,344
So… where are my meds?

6
00:00:43,344 --> 00:00:45,344
Right there, blind boy.

7
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:50,805
Ow—

8
00:00:53,453 --> 00:00:54,746
Stay there. I'll grab it for you.

9
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:12,245
You know…
I never thought you were cute.

10
00:01:29,376 --> 00:01:32,262
Not until last night.
And even now—

11
00:01:33,188 --> 00:01:35,968
You're actually really cute.

12
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:42,161
If you want to see me again…
can we meet?

13
00:01:42,988 --> 00:01:45,201
Idiot— no. That's enough.

14
00:01:47,071 --> 00:01:48,134
We'll see about that.

15
00:01:48,709 --> 00:01:50,283
And take your meds on time, okay?

16
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,817
Still… thanks for bringing me home again.

17
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:59,123
And what are you doing just standing there?
Not going inside?

18
00:01:59,271 --> 00:02:00,965
Want me to carry you to your bed?

19
00:02:03,095 --> 00:02:05,602
No need. I'm going.

20
00:02:06,898 --> 00:02:09,648
And tomorrow— act normal.

21
00:02:09,648 --> 00:02:11,304
I don't want anyone knowing.

22
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,848
Go rest already.

23
00:02:17,218 --> 00:02:18,302
Drive home safely, okay?
